WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.198
This query filters sales before returning results In
Spark filters

00:00:06.211 --> 00:00:10.566
can be especially important because they may reduce
how much data needs to be processed

00:00:12.307 --> 00:00:16.754
When data is stored in an efficient format and
partitioned well some filters can help

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:22.660
avoid scanning unnecessary data The teaching habit
is simple filter

00:00:22.687 --> 00:00:24.384
as early as the logic allows
